spoiler ahead

Take of everything, Armor, weapons and rings and let them
hit you.  They will add you hitpoint up to max and the add one point
for every couple of hits.  Good Idea to get in a room and lock
the door (Wiz lock is best) and read a cursed scroll of genocide.

See those hit points go up.  happy hacking.
